/* Menstruapp service worker.
 * - App shell + all modules precached per version → instant, fully offline start.
 * - New versions wait until the user taps "Update" (no mixed versions, no surprise reloads).
 * - /api/* is never cached.
 * - Push and periodic-sync reminders are decrypted here with the device's notification key.
 */
